Prepared transactions captured on Canton MainNet, copied unchanged from two
Apache-2.0 projects. None was signed and every deadline has passed. The tests
that verify them sign each hash with a throwaway key, which verify accepts
because the caller supplies the payer's keys, and pin the clock inside the
capture's deadline.


